{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to survive the tempest? Face the storm with the Y5S3 Legacy Pass, which brings back 100 tiers of rewards from the Y5S3 Battle Pass. Available during Y9S3 only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Legacy Pass includes the following rewards:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 Execution (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 Weapon Set (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 Podium (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 Battle Outfits (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 Effects (idle/emote/execution per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various customization elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A special #101 tier including all above content for all heroes released after Y5S3 to date</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you already own the Y5S3 Battle Pass, you do not need to purchase the Legacy Pass and you will continue where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Y5S3 Legacy Pass is available until December 2, 2025, and is not eligible for refund.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888030?t=1757596512","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888030?t=1757596512","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888030/c1b86a0d355731e723de05eb5a5760bae2a526c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757596512","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888030/c1b86a0d355731e723de05eb5a5760bae2a526c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757596512","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":